{"id":305,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"During territorial disputes, Lairon fight by slamming into each other. Close inspection of their steel armor reveals scratches and dents."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"Lairon live in mountains brimming with spring water and iron ore, so these Pokémon often came into conflict with humans in the past."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Lairon feeds on iron contained in rocks and water. It makes its nest on mountains where iron ore is buried. As a result, the Pokémon often clashes with humans mining the iron ore."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"Lairon tempers its steel body by drinking highly nutritious mineral springwater until it is bloated. This Pokémon makes its nest close to springs of delicious water."},{"games":["Y","LeafGreen","FireRed"],"text":"It habitually shows off its strength with the size of sparks it creates by ramming its steel body into boulders."},{"games":["X","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"It loves iron ore. Groups of them fight for territory by bashing one another with their steel bodies."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2"],"text":"Lairon fight over territory, and when their steel bodies collide, sparks fly."},{"games":["White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"For food, it digs up iron ore. It smashes its steely body against others to fight over territory."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"When two LAIRON meet in the wild, they fight for territory by bashing into each other with their steel bodies. The sound of their collision carries for miles."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Sturdy","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon cannot be knocked out by a single hit as long as its HP is full. One-hit KO moves will also fail to knock it out."},{"name":"Rock Head","hidden":false,"description":"Protects the Pokémon from recoil damage."},{"name":"Heavy Metal","hidden":true,"description":"Doubles the Pokémon's weight."}],"eggGroups":["Monster"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":35,"baseHappiness":35,"growthRate":"slow","habitat":"mountain","color":"Gray","shape":"Quadruped","evolution":{"id":304,"name":"Aron","condition":null,"children":[{"id":305,"name":"Lairon","condition":"Lv. 32","children":[{"id":306,"name":"Aggron","condition":"Lv. 42","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Sword / Shield","level":[[1,33],[1,106],[1,232],[1,317],[12,46],[16,29],[20,182],[24,157],[28,442],[35,319],[40,36],[46,475],[52,231],[58,334],[64,484],[70,38],[76,368]],"machine":[213,776,34,523,91,414,89,203,263,484,334,442,231,182,240,156,179,350,157,317,496,328,201,103,421,214,173,446,707,444,164,241,276,253],"egg":[],"tutor":[796,798]},"cards":[{"id":"sv6-184","name":"Lairon","set":"Twilight Masquerade","date":"2024-05-24","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"184","artist":"Dsuke","img":"sv6/184"},{"id":"sv6-121","name":"Lairon","set":"Twilight Masquerade","date":"2024-05-24","rarity":"Common","number":"121","artist":"takashi shiraishi","img":"sv6/121"},{"id":"swsh12pt5-88","name":"Lairon","set":"Crown Zenith","date":"2023-01-20","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"88","artist":"Mina Nakai","img":"swsh12pt5/88"},{"id":"swsh6-110","name":"Lairon","set":"Chilling Reign","date":"2021-06-18","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"110","artist":"HYOGONOSUKE","img":"swsh6/110"},{"id":"swsh3-122","name":"Lairon","set":"Darkness Ablaze","date":"2020-08-14","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"122","artist":"Mizue","img":"swsh3/122"},{"id":"sm10-124","name":"Lairon","set":"Unbroken Bonds","date":"2019-05-03","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"124","artist":"Suwama Chiaki","img":"sm10/124"},{"id":"sm4-66","name":"Lairon","set":"Crimson Invasion","date":"2017-11-03","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"66","artist":"Atsuko Nishida","img":"sm4/66"},{"id":"dc1-13","name":"Team Magma's Lairon","set":"Double Crisis","date":"2015-03-25","rarity":"Common","number":"13","artist":"Masakazu Fukuda","img":"dc1/13"},{"id":"bw10-58","name":"Lairon","set":"Plasma Blast","date":"2013-08-14","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"58","a